  }.start();' After the quick-fix is applied: 'new Thread(() -> {
    System.out.println("Hello from thread!");
  }).start();' This inspection depends on the Java feature 'ThreadLocal.withInitial()', which is available since Java 8. Inspection ID: AnonymousHasLambdaAlternative

