When reading code using such a method, it can be difficult to decipher what the `boolean` stands for without looking at
the source or documentation.

This problem is also known as [the boolean trap](https://ariya.io/2011/08/hall-of-api-shame-boolean-trap).
The `boolean` parameter can often be replaced with an `enum`.

Example:


