fullDescription.text:
Reports usages of the ternary condition operator and suggests converting them to 'if'/'else' statements. Some code standards prohibit the use of the condition operator. Example: 'Object result = (condition) ? foo() : bar();' After the quick-fix is applied: 'Object result;
