      if (str == null) {}


The inspection's behavior may be controlled by annotations, such as
[nullability](https://www.jetbrains.com/help/idea/nullable-and-notnull-annotations.html) annotations,
[@Contract](https://www.jetbrains.com/help/idea/contract-annotations.html) annotation,
