      if (obj instanceof Point(int x, int y)) {
        System.out.println(x + y);
      }
    }
  }' This inspection depends on the Java feature 'Pattern guards and record patterns', which is available since Java 21. Inspection ID: DeconstructionCanBeUsed New in 2023.1

