fullDescription.text:
Reports calls to 'Enumeration' methods that are used on collections and may be replaced with equivalent 'Iterator' constructs. Example: 'Enumeration<String> keys = map.keys();
  while (keys.hasMoreElements()) {
    String name = keys.nextElement();
  }' After the quick-fix is applied: 'Iterator<String> iterator = map.keySet().iterator();
