fullDescription.text:
Reports 'Externalizable' classes that define 'readObject()' or 'writeObject()' methods. These methods are not called for serialization of 'Externalizable' objects. Example: 'abstract class Crucial implements Externalizable {
    int value;
    private void readObject(ObjectInputStream in) {
      value = in.readInt();
