    doSomethingAfter();
  } else {
    doSomethingBefore();
    doSomethingDifferent2();
    doSomethingAfter();
  }' After the quick-fix is applied: 'doSomethingBefore();
  if (x > 12) {
    doSomethingDifferent1();
  } else {
    doSomethingDifferent2();
  }
  doSomethingAfter();' Updated in 2018.1 Inspection ID: IfStatementWithIdenticalBranches

