fullDescription.text:
Reports local variable declarations that can be replaced with pattern variables, which are usually more compact. Example: 'if (obj instanceof String) {
    String str = (String) obj;
    System.out.println(str);
  }' Can be replaced with: 'if (obj instanceof String str) {
    System.out.println(str);
  }' This inspection depends on the Java feature 'Patterns in 'instanceof'', which is available since Java 16. Inspection ID: PatternVariableCanBeUsed New in 2020.1

