  public void setName() {
    this.name = name;
  }
}' Use the Ignore if annotated by list to specify special annotations. Methods annotated with one of these annotations will be ignored by this inspection. Use the Ignore if the containing class does not implement a non-library interface option to ignore methods from classes which do not implement any interface from the project. Inspection ID: PublicMethodNotExposedInInterface

