    getClass().isAnnotationPresent(SourceAnnotation.class); //always false
  }

  @Retention(RetentionPolicy.SOURCE)
  @interface SourceAnnotation {}' This inspection depends on the Java feature 'Annotations', which is available since Java 5. Inspection ID: ReflectionForUnavailableAnnotation

