fullDescription.text:
Reports variable and method return types that can be changed to a more abstract (weaker) type. This allows making the code more abstract, hence more reusable. Example: '// Type of parameter can be weakened to java.util.List
  void processList(ArrayList<String> list) {
    if (list.isEmpty()) return;
