    @Override
    public int compareTo(Example o) {
      return 0;
    }
  }' After the quick-fix is applied: 'class Example implements Comparable<Example> {
    @Override
    public int compareTo(Example o) {
      return 0;
    }
  }' Inspection ID: UnnecessaryInheritDoc

