Inspection ID: GroovyTrivialIf

fullDescription.text:
Reports 'continue' statements if they are last reachable statements in the loop. These 'continue' statements are unnecessary and can be safely removed. Example: 'for(int i in array) {
      println(i)
      continue
  }' After the quick-fix is applied: 'for(int i in array) {
      println(i)
  }' For more information, see the same inspection in Java. Inspection ID: GroovyUnnecessaryContinue

