fullDescription.text:
Reports 'if' statements with three or more branches that can be replaced with the 'when' expression with a subject. Example: 'fun translateNumber(n: Int): String {
    return if (n == 1) {
      "one"
    } else if (n == 2) {
      "two"
    } else {
      "???"
    }
  }' The quick-fix converts the 'if' expression to 'when': 'fun translateNumber(n: Int): String {
    return when (n) {
      1 -> {
        "one"
      }
      2 -> {
        "two"
      }
      else -> {
        "???"
      }
    }
  }' Inspection ID: CascadeIf

