{
    "foo": $ref,
    "bar": {
        "baz": "$20"
        "boo": "$${100 + 200}"
    }
}
"""' After the quick fix is applied: 'val foo = """
{
    "foo": ${'$'}ref,
    "bar": {
        "baz": "$20"
        "boo": "${100 + 200}"
    }
}
"""' Inspection ID: ConvertFromMultiDollarToRegularString

