Calling 'toString()' on an array returns the address of the object in memory, not a string representation of the array's contents. This is almost never what you want. To get a string representation of an array correctly, use: 'contentToString()' for linear arrays 'contentDeepToString()' for multidimensional arrays Example (explicit toString): 'fun main() {
